arpet to fit along wall edges, openings, and projections, finishing the edges with a wall trimmer.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2834","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.7}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.7,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E1","score":0.3333333333333333,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#5","text":"Stretch carpet to align with walls and ensure a smooth surface, and press carpet in place over tack strips or use staples, tape, tacks or glue to hold carpet in place.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2838","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E1","score":0.3333333333333333,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#6","text":"Roll out, measure, mark, and cut carpeting to size with a carpet knife, following floor sketches and allowing extra carpet for final fitting.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2836","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E1","score":0.3333333333333333,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#7","text":"Nail tack strips around area to be carpeted or use old strips to attach edges of new carpet.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2842","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.1,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E0","score":0,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#8","text":"Inspect the surface to be covered to determine its condition, and correct any imperfections that might show through carpet or cause carpet to wear unevenly.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2835","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.4}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.4,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E1","score":0.3333333333333333,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#9","text":"Take measurements and study floor sketches to calculate the area to be carpeted and the amount of material needed.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2839","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.3}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.3,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E2","score":0.6666666666666666,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#10","text":"Install carpet on some floors using adhesive, following prescribed method.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2841","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.4}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.4,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E0","score":0,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#11","text":"Clean up before and after installation, including vacuuming carpet and discarding remnant pieces.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"20142","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.5}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.5,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E1","score":0.3333333333333333,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#12","text":"Draw building diagrams and record dimensions.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2845","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.1,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E2","score":0.6666666666666666,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#13","text":"Cut and install vinyl composition tile or vinyl base.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"24050","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.007}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.007,"ai":null,"robotics":null},{"id":"47-2041.00#14","text":"Fasten metal treads across door openings or where carpet meets flooring to hold carpet in place.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2843","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.2}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.2,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E0","score":0,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#15","text":"Move furniture from area to be carpeted and remove old carpet and padding.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2846","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.6}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.6,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E0","score":0,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#16","text":"Measure, cut and install tackless strips along the baseboard or wall.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2844","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.4}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.4,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E1","score":0.3333333333333333,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#17","text":"Cut and bind material.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"2847","via":"47-2041.00","match":"native","w":0.1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.1,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E1","score":0.3333333333333333,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"47-2041.00#18","text":"interpret 3D plans","kind":"skill","esco_uri":"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/aafbb139-02c6-4f35-bc62-ff73faf97d6d","sources":[{"source":"esco","ref":"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/aafbb139-02c6-4f35-bc62-ff73faf97d6d","via":"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/e43d0f86-7abf-4c6e-b2b3-10970ddf6518","match":"exactMatch","essential":true,"w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":null,"robotics":null},{"id":"47